msgid "God... damn... it..."
msgstr "Mierda..."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "84_Saejima"
msgid "I'm gonna let you in on a little secret."
msgstr "Escuchen bien lo que les voy a decir."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=2
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P2
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "96_Difficult Patron"
msgid "Huh?"
msgstr "¿Eh?"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "108_Saejima"
msgid "Gambling's a battle between gamblers and the house."
msgstr "Las apuestas se tratan de un enfrentamiento constante\n"
"entre el apostador y la casa."

msgctxt "120_Saejima"
msgid "If there's somethin' sketchy going on, the only loser\\r\n"
"is the one who didn't already realize it."
msgstr "Si no eres lo suficiente astuto para darte cuenta de que\n"
"algo está pasando, pierdes. Es así de simple."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=5
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P5
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "132_Difficult Patron"
msgid "So you admit they cheated me...!"
msgstr "¡O sea que admites que hicieron trampa!..."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=6
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P6
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "144_Saejima"
msgid "This place is different, though. I think."
msgstr "No. Me parece que no es esa clase de casino."

msgctxt "156_Saejima"
msgid "The fact they went outta their way to hire a bouncer\\r\n"
"like me to keep out punks like you proves they wanna\\r\n"
"do business on the level."
msgstr "Se tomaron la molestia de contratar a alguien como yo para\n"
"intentar alejar a clientes como ustedes. Eso demuestra que\n"
"es un negocio legítimo."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=8
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P8
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "168_Difficult Patron"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr "Ugh..."

msgctxt "180_Saejima"
msgid "Either way, you assholes were in the wrong. Can't handle\\r\n"
"losing in a game of chance? Then get a new fuckin' hobby."
msgstr "Y, siendo realistas, los únicos que han hecho mal son ustedes.\n"
"Si no son capaces de aceptar la derrota en un juego de azar,\n"
"búsquense otra forma de perder el tiempo."

msgctxt "192_Saejima"
msgid "Next time, I ain't gonna go half so easy on ya.\\r\n"
"You hear me?"
msgstr "Pero les advierto que no seré tan piadoso la próxima vez que\n"
"los sorprenda. ¿Me entendieron?"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=11
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P11
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "204_Difficult Patron"
msgid "Loud and clear!"
msgstr "¡¡S-sí!! ¡¡Aaaaaaaah!!"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=12
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P12
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "216_Saejima"
msgid "(There. That'll learn 'em.)"
msgstr "(Espero que eso les haya servido de lección)."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=0
#. y4:msg_phrase=13
#. y4:msg_location=T0.P13
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "228_Saejima"
msgid "(Guess that's a job well done.)"
msgstr "(Muy bien. Trabajo terminado)."

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=0
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P0
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "264_Difficult Patron"
msgid "There he is, the bastard!"
msgstr "¡Hasta que saliste, hijo de perra!"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=1
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P1
#. y4:msg_speaker=Saejima
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=1
msgctxt "276_Saejima"
msgid "Not you again."
msgstr "Vaya..., creí que se habían largado."

msgctxt "288_Difficult Patron"
msgid "You made an ass out of me in there. I'm not gonna let you\\r\n"
"just walk away after that!"
msgstr "Desgraciado... ¡Me hiciste quedar como un payaso!\\r\n"
"¡No te vas a salir con la tuya!"

#. y4:msg_type=dialogue
#. y4:msg_label=Diálogo
#. y4:msg_talk=1
#. y4:msg_phrase=3
#. y4:msg_location=T1.P3
#. y4:msg_speaker=Difficult Patron
#. y4:msg_speaker_id=0
msgctxt "300_Difficult Patron"
msgid "Come on, guys. Let's beat the shit outta this meathead!"
msgstr "¡Muchachos, démosle a este cretino una paliza de la\n"
"que nunca se olvidará!"

msgctxt "312_Complaining Accomplice"
msgid "And after you, we'll take the casino for all it's worth.\\r\n"
"All that cash will be ours!"
msgstr "Y luego de acabar contigo, ¡nos llevaremos hasta el último\n"
"yen de ese puto casino!"

msgctxt "324_Difficult Patron"
msgid "You better believe it. After all, money's wasted on those\\r\n"
"homeless pieces of trash!"
msgstr "¡Sería un desperdicio dejar que esos asquerosos vagabundos\n"
"manipulen todo ese dinero!"

msgctxt "336_Saejima"
msgid "Enough of that shit. You think you can do anything\\r\n"
"ya want 'cause you're up against homeless folks?"
msgstr "Imbéciles... ¿Creen que tienen el derecho de hacer lo que les\n"
"plazca solo porque es un casino de sintechos?"

msgctxt "348_Difficult Patron"
msgid "You've got one hell of a big mouth, pal!\\r\n"
"C'mon, let's shut him up for good!"
msgstr "¡No me vengas con tu superioridad moral, canalla!\n"
"¡Vamos a cerrarte esa boca de una vez!"
